    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この抹茶碗、美しい色合いですね。お茶が点て易い形\nですし、幅広い方にお勧めできそうです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あら、この反物いいじゃないの。\nとても目を引く意匠だわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "馴染みのものがあると思えば、やはり高座扇で\nにゃんしたか。これは良いものでにゃんす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さん、やはり馴染みの伝統工芸品に\n目が行ってますね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すみません、つい……。ですが、他の伝統工芸品も\n素晴らしいものばかりです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この品々をたくさんの若い方たちに見て頂けるよう、\nしっかりPRしたいと思います。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "019kur",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 18
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よろしくお願いします。伝統芸能に携わってきた皆\nさんだからこそ、伝えられることがあると思います！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 19
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そこを買われて依頼された仕事だろう？\n期待された以上の結果を出してみせるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "018shm",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 20
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ワガハイたちのぱわーで、らいぶだけじゃなく\n展示会も、どど～んと盛り上げるでにゃんすよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "017kir",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 21
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30011_01_a:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい、楽しみにしてます！　では、打ち合わせまで\n時間があるので、もう少し展示品を見ましょうか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
